The one loose thread in the context pack (the follow-up "Why are you doing this from the stale fake branch?") is a separate, unrelated failure mode (wrong branch), which the dedup analysis correctly routes elsewhere (R4) rather than folding into this remedy — so it doesn't count against this remedy's coverage of the actual incident being evaluated here.

